   "t": "so why are you chilling in this corner?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1069,
   "src": "fe46cca64783",
   "t": "...Huh?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1072,
   "src": "a1b08a9eccc9",
   "t": "This is the {{exploration_club}}'s booth!?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1080,
   "src": "3a5cbd11dcaa",
